                        804</ref>. For another Soviet proposal on this subject, see <ref
                        target="#d1423">document No. 1423</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1064-f2" n="2" xml:id="d1064-f2-content">
                <p>See <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg150">p. 150</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1064-f3" n="3" xml:id="d1064-f3-content">
                <p>Damaskinos, Archbishop of Greece.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
